sequenceDiagram
  autonumber

  box #E8F5E9 Your implementation (Publisher SaaS)
    participant App as 你方：产品（Your Product）
    participant Agg as 你方：Usage Aggregator
    participant DB as 你方：Usage/Audit DB
  end

  box #E3F2FD Platform (Microsoft Commercial Marketplace)
    participant Meter as 平台：Marketplace Metering
  end

  Note over Meter: 平台侧（Marketplace 提供）
  Note over App,DB: 你方实现侧（Publisher SaaS 要实现）

  App->>Agg: Emit raw usage events
  Agg->>DB: Persist raw usage (idempotent)
  loop Every N minutes/hour
    Agg->>DB: Aggregate (subscription + dimension)
    Agg->>Meter: Emit usage event
    alt Success
      Meter-->>Agg: 2xx + usageEventId
      Agg->>DB: Mark reported + store response
    else Failure
      Meter-->>Agg: error
      Agg->>DB: Record failure + schedule retry
    end
  end